# P23 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): the AppKit file's rows and selection steps; only the drag moves.
# Measured 2026-10-16 from p23-macos-gtk4-final-20261016-095712.png (1640x1296, halved to 820x648; origin=frame, 28 pt native title bar). The More rows (157,165), Fewer rows (63,165) and Selection (66,197) clicks of the AppKit file land on GTK's buttons too. Its drag at y 267 is an AppKit row-1 position and landed on the selected row label here; GTK's row 1 is at y 470, its third column from x 437.
# After this file: rows: 16, Selection on, and the drag across row 1's third cell reported by the line beside the Selection button.
